://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it doesn't seem to resolve another issue I could reproduce on `master` (maybe it's not related).\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_npot.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20111489/test_npot.zip)\r\n\r\nFrom left to right: diffuse (top) and normal (bottom) textures from 248x248 to 256x256.\r\n\r\nThe ones that are 253x253, 254x254 and 255x255 have a broken last mipmap, as evidenced by this view with mipmap LOD bias set to `+16.0`:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-09 000839](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb5db601-aeef-4731-9599-2417761ee1d7)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-09 000925](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1b7347fb-1f7c-4e93-a8e7-a0ebe31297b2)\r\n\r\nWith High Quality enabled:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-09 000853](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cdc97ad-8b2c-4fe9-88a0-b169665b6dcb)\r\n\r\nFor the affected sizes, the color of the last mipmap changes on each reimport. This occurs both with High Quality VRAM compression enabled and disabled, but not when using lossless compression instead.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103276#pullrequestreview-2826477173","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103276","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-08T22:16:36Z"},{"id":2826497737,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6oeO7J","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"8402a1d0bd72c301f7278f6f7e4821e37dfc1f29","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da